   "summary": "This study measured the environmental characteristics and taxonomic composition of Chironomidae collected from 44 surface samples across different habitats, including Sphagnum hummocks and peatland pools. The study measured the relative abundance and frequency of various chironomid taxa across five different peatland habitats (hummock, hollow, ditch, pond, and pool)."
